@baseUrl = https://localhost:7443
@clientId = squirrel-local
@clientSecret = local-development-only
@code = paste-code-from-callback
@accessToken = paste-access-token
@refreshToken = paste-refresh-token

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Discovery
GET {{baseUrl}}/.well-known/openid-configuration

### Public keys
GET {{baseUrl}}/.well-known/jwks.json

### Email-only login (open in a browser to keep its CSRF cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/authorize?response_type=code&client_id={{clientId}}&redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%3A5173%2Fcallback&scope=openid%20profile%20email%20offline_access&audience=https%3A%2F%2Fsquirrel.local%2Fapi&state=example-state

### Submit login (use matching values and cookie from the GET login page)
POST {{baseUrl}}/authorize
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Cookie: auth0mock.csrf=paste-cookie

request_id=paste-request-id&email=developer%40example.com&__RequestVerificationToken=paste-form-token

### Exchange the single-use code
POST {{baseUrl}}/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&client_id={{clientId}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}&code={{code}}&redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%3A5173%2Fcallback

### Current profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/userinfo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Refresh and rotate (replace stored refresh token with the returned value)
POST {{baseUrl}}/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&client_id={{clientId}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}&refresh_token={{refreshToken}}

### Revoke a refresh-token family
POST {{baseUrl}}/oauth/revoke
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{clientId}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}&token={{refreshToken}}&token_type_hint=refresh_token

### Logout
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/logout?client_id={{clientId}}&returnTo=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%3A5173

### Invalid redirect (400; never redirects)
GET {{baseUrl}}/authorize?response_type=code&client_id={{clientId}}&redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Funtrusted.example%2Fcallback&scope=openid

### Missing access token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/userinfo

### OpenAPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
